 should check the GitHub repository status to provide an accurate progress report. Let me run a command to check the Git remote configuration in the workspace directory. I need to be careful with Windows encoding as per the qclaw-rules skill. I'll run PowerShell commands to set UTF-8 encoding and then check the Git remote. After checking the status, I'll output a reminder to the user about the incomplete tasks","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我已读取 qclaw-rules 技能。现在需要检查 cron 任务中提到的两项待办事项的进度。让我先检查 WeCom CLI 的初始化状态，刚才的命令有语法错误，让我重新执行。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b65f475b8b784ba0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"powershell -Command \"[Console]::OutputEncoding = [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8; $OutputEncoding = [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8; chcp 65001; Test-Path '$env:USERPROFILE\\.wecom-cli\\config.json'\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qclaw","model":"modelroute","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778637823663,"responseId":"92b68dd50f01a1f1"}}
